{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57913","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57913","key":"SV-11419","fields":{"summary":"Board View and Tech View – More Actions Menu Has No Unassign Item","parent":{"id":"56398","key":"SV-10054","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56398","fields":{"summary":"Keyboard access and focus — design questions to resolve","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}},"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62421","id":"62421","filename":"C368152-2-menu-has-no-unassign.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T05:43:27.464-0500","size":95094,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62421","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62421"}],"description":"h2. Description\n\n*The More actions (⋯) menu of a work order that has a lead technician should offer Unassign as a menu item*, so the lead can be removed with the keyboard. On staging the menu offers only *Reassign lead technician*.\n\nFor example,\n\n* a work order led by a technician shows one item in its More actions menu: \"Reassign lead technician\"\n* there is no \"Unassign\" item, so the keyboard user has no direct way to remove the lead\n\nh2. Steps to Reproduce\n\n# Sign in to staging as an Admin and check the top bar shows *Staging Heavy Duty - 9919*.\n# Open *Work Orders*, click the *All* tab, type a customer whose work order has a lead technician in *Search* (for example {{ZZAUTOTEST F3 Keyboard Reassign}}) and click *Board View*.\n# Move focus to a card that has a lead technician (for example {{S2-36358}}, led by ZZAUTOTEST Ben Bravo), press Tab to its *More actions* (⋯) button and press Enter.\n#* The menu opens with one item: \"Reassign lead technician\".\n#* There is no \"Unassign\" item.\n\n*Actual Result:*\n\n* The More actions menu offers only \"Reassign lead technician\".\n\n*Expected Result:*\n\n* The menu offers *Reassign lead technician* and *Unassign*; choosing Unassign moves the work order to Unassigned and shows \"Lead technician removed\".\n\nh2. Screenshots\n\n!C368152-2-menu-has-no-unassign.png|width=1962,height=1084!\n\nh2. Environment\n\n* *Build:* {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}} on [staging|https://app.staging.shopview.com/workorders] · *Location:* Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 · *User:* Admin · seen 16 Oct 2026\n\nh2. Sources\n\n* [PRD – Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (Confluence page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026), S11-R9:\nReassigning by keyboard goes through the more-actions menu: Reassign lead technician opens the Reassign dialog, and Unassign is a menu item. There is no keyboard drag in this release, so reordering work orders and technicians is by mouse or touch only.\n* Same page, S4-R5:\nAfter successful reassignment, show “Lead technician updated”; after unassigning, show “Lead technician removed”.\n\nh2. Test case\n\n* [C368152 Reassign and Unassign work from the keyboard through the More actions menu|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/368152]","issuelinks":[{"id":"33598","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33598","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"56398","key":"SV-10054","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56398","fields":{"summary":"Keyboard access and focus — design questions to resolve","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}}}],"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57913/comment/78875","id":"78875","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb] valid. Add Unassign to the more-actions menu as in the design (red, x icon, only when the work order has a lead, disabled when locked). It goes through the same shift-clearing prompt (S4-R26) and Invoiced/Paid lock as other lead changes. [~accountid:712020:b2d16ade-9013-4875-8a9d-e255e63e8217] [